{
  "name": "A · Auditoría programada CIS",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flujo A · Auditoría programada\n\n1. n8n dispara cada 15 minutos.\n2. El backend selecciona programaciones vencidas con bloqueo para evitar duplicados.\n3. Ejecuta checks de solo lectura, calcula score, guarda evidencia y actualiza hallazgos.\n4. Consulta el resumen del dashboard.\n\n**Credencial requerida:** HTTP Header Auth llamada `CIS Hardening API Key` con `X-API-Key` y un token de alcance `automation:execute`.\n\nAjuste `apiBaseUrl` al host real del backend.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Documentación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Cada 15 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "apiBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/api/v1",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').first().json.apiBaseUrl }}/automation/audits/run-due",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Ejecutar auditorías vencidas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "cis-hardening-api-key",
          "name": "CIS Hardening API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.runs_started }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "¿Se iniciaron ejecuciones?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [500, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').first().json.apiBaseUrl }}/dashboard",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Consultar resumen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [760, -100],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "cis-hardening-api-key",
          "name": "CIS Hardening API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const dashboard = $input.first().json;\nconst runs = $('Ejecutar auditorías vencidas').first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ejecutado_en: new Date().toISOString(),\n    programaciones_vencidas: runs.due_schedules ?? 0,\n    ejecuciones_iniciadas: runs.runs_started ?? 0,\n    servidores_auditados: dashboard.summary?.audited_servers ?? 0,\n    cumplimiento_promedio: dashboard.summary?.average_score ?? null,\n    hallazgos_altos_criticos: (dashboard.summary?.findings_critical ?? 0) + (dashboard.summary?.findings_high ?? 0),\n    detalle: runs.items ?? []\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Resumen de ejecución",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1020, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Sin ejecuciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [760, 100]
    }
  ],
